{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached grab it, if identified, take it and check its properties, finally either scan or perform the task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectIdentified    />",
